{"total_count":1703,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/commits/d7419c9bb3366ec82d1405221376e0ab281b9360","sha":"d7419c9bb3366ec82d1405221376e0ab281b9360","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0NjU2MDA5NzU6ZDc0MTljOWJiMzM2NmVjODJkMTQwNTIyMTM3NmUwYWIyODFiOTM2MA==","html_url":"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/commit/d7419c9bb3366ec82d1405221376e0ab281b9360","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/commits/d7419c9bb3366ec82d1405221376e0ab281b9360/comments","commit":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/git/commits/d7419c9bb3366ec82d1405221376e0ab281b9360","author":{"date":"2026-07-13T14:27:31.000-03:00","name":"Guilherme Leobas","email":"guilhermeleobas@gmail.com"},"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T21:07:02.000Z","name":"PyTorch MergeBot","email":"pytorchmergebot@users.noreply.github.com"},"message":"[dynamo] Represent ConstDictVariable as dict only; split OrderedDict storage (#189549)\n\nConstDictVariable previously carried a `user_cls` field and branched on it at\nruntime (dict vs OrderedDict vs defaultdict vs user dict subclass) for the\nitems container type, python_type, reconstruct bytecode, and hasattr. This\nmade it a single VT impersonating many types, which does not fit the\ndeclarative per-VT type-slot model (tp_methods, _cpython_type): those slots are\nper-type, so a VT that is many types cannot cleanly declare any of them.\n\nThis makes ConstDictVariable represent plain `dict` only. `_cpython_type` now\ndoubles as the backing container class for `self.items` and the value returned\nby `python_type()`, chosen per subclass instead of by a runtime argument. The\nOrderedDict-specific storage (an OrderedDict container for move_to_end /\npopitem(last=), and `OrderedDict(...)` reconstruct) moves to a new\n`OrderedItemsDictVariable(ConstDictVariable)`, which is what\n`OrderedDictVariable._base_vt` now wraps. `NNModuleHooksDictVariable` subclasses\nit since nn.Module hook dicts are OrderedDict. immutable_dict, previously\ntracked via user_cls, is represented as a plain dict VT (it cannot be the\ncontainer: it is immutable and ConstDictVariable mutates items during tracing).\n\nAll ConstDictVariable construction sites that passed a dict type (builder\nsourced and sourceless paths, builtin dict()/fromkeys, functions, torch,\nuser_defined, nn_module, vars()/locals() snapshot) are updated to select the\nconcrete VT class instead of passing user_cls.\n\nThis was authored with the assistance of Claude Code.\n\nTest Plan:\n```\npixi run -w pytorch -e pytorch310 python test/dynamo/test_dicts.py\npixi run -w pytorch -e pytorch310 python test/dynamo/test_repros.py\npixi run -w pytorch -e pytorch310 python test/dynamo/test_higher_order_ops.py\npixi run -w pytorch -e pytorch310 python test/dynamo/test_modules.py\npixi run -w pytorch -e pytorch310 python test/dynamo/test_hooks.py\n```\n\nPull Request resolved: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/189549\nApproved by: https://github.com/rtimpe","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/git/trees/ef11b90931b3434968cdfbf1b822d2fe0589a896","sha":"ef11b90931b3434968cdfbf1b822d2fe0589a896"},"comment_count":0},"author":{"login":"guilhermeleobas","id":2712115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MTIxMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2712115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermeleobas","html_url":"https://github.com/guilhermeleobas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermeleobas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermeleobas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermeleobas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermeleobas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermeleobas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermeleobas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guilhermeleobas/repos","events